OL,3,GNEWSAEx-lifeboat gets stuck on mudflats
OL,4,
OL,5,FAn HM Coastguard team has been called
OL,6,Fout to help a former lifeboat that ran
OL,7,Faground on mudflats.
OL,9,FA member of the public called the
OL,10,FSouthend HM Coastguard team on Thursday
OL,11,Fafter they saw the boat "suddenly" stop
OL,12,Fone kilometre west of Southend Pier.
OL,14,FSix officers with personal flotation
OL,15,Fdevices set off across the "sticky mud"
OL,16,Ftowards the stricken vessel. They found
OL,17,Ftwo people on board, who were advised
OL,18,Fto wait for the tide to rise again.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
