OL,3,GNEWSAEx-lifeboat gets stuck on mudflats
OL,4,
OL,5,FA spokesperson for HM Coastguard said
OL,6,Fon Facebook: "Luckily no-one was
OL,7,Finjured and the crew were well within
OL,8,Fthe inner channel marker buoys, but
OL,9,Funfortunately the tide had turned
OL,10,Fquicker than expected so they found
OL,11,Fthemselves aground."
